Why would you create separate clusters?

You might use separate clusters when you want strong infrastructure separation, such as:

Different teams
Different environments
Different security requirements
Different compute requirements
Easier operational management

But ECS does not require one cluster per application.

One important point

In a large application like Amazon, you wouldn't normally have just one service. It could have many microservices:

Amazon ECS Cluster
